# Blizzard requires a snow land its caster controls, has cumulative upkeep {2}, and stops flying creatures of both players untapping while ground creatures untap (CR 702.24a, 502.3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Blizzard
Snow-Covered Forest
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Snow-Covered Plains
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Snow-Covered Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
